      "name": "M.Tech - Internet of Things (IoT)",
      "code": "MTECH-IOT",
      "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">The&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">M.Tech.&nbsp;in&nbsp;Internet&nbsp;of&nbsp;Things&nbsp;(IoT)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;two-year&nbsp;postgraduate&nbsp;program&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;develop&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;and&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;in&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;technologies.&nbsp;The&nbsp;program&nbsp;covers&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;architecture,&nbsp;embedded&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;sensors,&nbsp;wireless&nbsp;communication,&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;computing,&nbsp;edge&nbsp;computing,&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics,&nbsp;and&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;security.&nbsp;Through&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;laboratory&nbsp;work,&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;and&nbsp;industry-oriented&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;students&nbsp;develop&nbsp;the&nbsp;ability&nbsp;to&nbsp;design,&nbsp;implement,&nbsp;and&nbsp;manage&nbsp;intelligent&nbsp;systems&nbsp;for&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;applications.</span></p>",
      "hodName": "Dr.UdayBhanu Singh Chandrawat",
      "hodImage": "https://assets.platanist.com/departments/hod/1787646819101-835879638.png",
      "hodMessage": "<p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">It&nbsp;gives&nbsp;me&nbsp;immense&nbsp;pleasure&nbsp;to&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;M.Tech.&nbsp;in&nbsp;Internet&nbsp;of&nbsp;Things&nbsp;(IoT)&nbsp;programme&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Department&nbsp;of&nbsp;Electronics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Communication&nbsp;Engineering.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">The&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;ecosystem&nbsp;is&nbsp;transforming&nbsp;industries&nbsp;and&nbsp;society&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;integration&nbsp;of&nbsp;sensors,&nbsp;embedded&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;communication&nbsp;technologies,&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;computing,&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics,&nbsp;and&nbsp;artificial&nbsp;intelligence.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;M.Tech.&nbsp;programme&nbsp;is&nbsp;designed&nbsp;to&nbsp;equip&nbsp;students&nbsp;with&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;technical&nbsp;knowledge,&nbsp;research&nbsp;capabilities,&nbsp;and&nbsp;practical&nbsp;skills&nbsp;to&nbsp;address&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;challenges&nbsp;in&nbsp;this&nbsp;rapidly&nbsp;evolving&nbsp;domain.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">We&nbsp;are&nbsp;committed&nbsp;to&nbsp;providing&nbsp;a&nbsp;learner-centric&nbsp;environment&nbsp;that&nbsp;encourages&nbsp;innovation,&nbsp;interdisciplinary&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;industry&nbsp;interaction,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;project&nbsp;development.&nbsp;Through&nbsp;our&nbsp;experienced&nbsp;faculty,&nbsp;modern&nbsp;laboratories,&nbsp;and&nbsp;industry-oriented&nbsp;approach,&nbsp;we&nbsp;aim&nbsp;to&nbsp;nurture&nbsp;competent&nbsp;professionals,&nbsp;researchers,&nbsp;and&nbsp;innovators&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&nbsp;contribute&nbsp;meaningfully&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;future&nbsp;of&nbsp;connected&nbsp;and&nbsp;intelligent&nbsp;systems.</span></p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">I&nbsp;wish&nbsp;all&nbsp;our&nbsp;students&nbsp;an&nbsp;enriching&nbsp;and&nbsp;successful&nbsp;academic&nbsp;journey.</span></p>",
      "achievements": [],
