                  "name": "MTIO 302: Elective-V",
                  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Covers&nbsp;specialized&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;that&nbsp;extend&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;applications&nbsp;into&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;domains.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;can&nbsp;choose&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wearable&nbsp;Computing,&nbsp;Augmented&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Virtual&nbsp;Reality,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Energy&nbsp;Harvesting&nbsp;Technologies&nbsp;and&nbsp;Power&nbsp;Management&nbsp;for&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;Devices</strong></p>",
                  "group": ""
                },
                {
                  "name": "MTIO 303: Seminar",
                  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Provides&nbsp;an&nbsp;opportunity&nbsp;to&nbsp;study&nbsp;and&nbsp;present&nbsp;a&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;topic&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;field&nbsp;of&nbsp;IoT&nbsp;through&nbsp;literature-based&nbsp;investigation.&nbsp;It&nbsp;develops&nbsp;students&#39;&nbsp;technical&nbsp;communication,&nbsp;presentation,&nbsp;critical&nbsp;analysis,&nbsp;and&nbsp;research&nbsp;skills.</span></p>"
