                {
                  "name": "MCA 101: Programming in C with Data Structures",
                  "description": "Introduces C programming fundamentals including data types, control structures, and functions. Covers important data structures such as stacks, queues, linked lists, and trees. Develops problem-solving skills and understanding of algorithm efficiency."
                },
