                  "name": "MCA 102: Statistical Mathematics",
                  "description": "Focuses on matrices, calculus, probability, and statistical methods. Includes hypothesis testing, distributions, and discrete mathematics concepts. Enhances analytical and quantitative problem-solving abilities."
