                  "name": "MCA 103: Operating Systems and Architecture",
                  "description": "Provides knowledge of computer architecture and operating system concepts. Covers process management, memory management, scheduling, and file systems. Builds understanding of system-level operations and resource management."
                },
                {
                  "name": "MCA 104: Information Technology",
                  "description": "Introduces modern IT concepts such as cloud computing, IoT, AI, and communication technologies. Covers information security and digital applications. Helps students understand current trends in the IT industry."
