                  "name": "Elective – I",
                  "description": "Students choose one: Python Programming (Covers Python basics, OOP, file handling, and modules for application development); Web Technology (Focuses on HTML, CSS, JavaScript, XML, and web services for web development); or Data Science & Big Data (Introduces data analytics, visualization, Hadoop, and big data tools)."
