      "description": "<p>MCA&nbsp;is&nbsp;focused&nbsp;on&nbsp;aligning&nbsp;conceptual&nbsp;learning&nbsp;to&nbsp;industry&nbsp;practices&nbsp;by&nbsp;creating&nbsp;an&nbsp;environment&nbsp;where&nbsp;creativity&nbsp;and&nbsp;innovation&nbsp;can&nbsp;flourish&nbsp;to&nbsp;transform&nbsp;academic&nbsp;learning&nbsp;into&nbsp;technical&nbsp;excellence.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;strong&nbsp;core&nbsp;faculty&nbsp;team&nbsp;drawn&nbsp;from&nbsp;industry&nbsp;and&nbsp;academia&nbsp;aim&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;the&nbsp;students&nbsp;industry&nbsp;ready&nbsp;by&nbsp;facilitating&nbsp;their&nbsp;training&nbsp;leading&nbsp;to&nbsp;various&nbsp;certifications.</p>",
      "hodImage": "https://assets.platanist.com/departments/hod/1779088603852-383747580.jpg",
      "hodMessage": "<p>The&nbsp;postgraduate&nbsp;programme&nbsp;of&nbsp;Master&nbsp;of&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Application&nbsp;(MCA)&nbsp;has&nbsp;been&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;course&nbsp;for&nbsp;non&nbsp;engineering&nbsp;aspirants&nbsp;who&nbsp;wish&nbsp;to&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;a&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;IT&nbsp;field&nbsp;for&nbsp;many&nbsp;years.&nbsp;The&nbsp;appeal&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;course&nbsp;lies&nbsp;in&nbsp;it&nbsp;being&nbsp;a&nbsp;very&nbsp;comprehensive&nbsp;curriculum&nbsp;which&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;good&nbsp;mix&nbsp;of&nbsp;fundamentals&nbsp;and&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;technologies.&nbsp;The&nbsp;special&nbsp;focus&nbsp;of&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;is&nbsp;towards&nbsp;domain&nbsp;specific&nbsp;and&nbsp;industry&nbsp;oriented&nbsp;curriculum&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;internship.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;can&nbsp;also&nbsp;opt&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;5&nbsp;year&nbsp;integrated&nbsp;programme&nbsp;in&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;after&nbsp;XII&nbsp;which&nbsp;is&nbsp;offered&nbsp;by&nbsp;select&nbsp;universities.&nbsp;This&nbsp;programme&nbsp;enables&nbsp;the&nbsp;students&nbsp;to&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;learning&nbsp;technology&nbsp;domains&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;fundamental&nbsp;courses&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;very&nbsp;structured&nbsp;way.&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;ideal&nbsp;course&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;students&nbsp;who&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;the&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;gradual&nbsp;but&nbsp;consistent&nbsp;manner.&nbsp;This&nbsp;will&nbsp;help&nbsp;in&nbsp;fulfilling&nbsp;the&nbsp;increased&nbsp;demand&nbsp;for&nbsp;domain&nbsp;experts&nbsp;in&nbsp;these&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;fields.&nbsp;Today&nbsp;the&nbsp;industry&nbsp;is&nbsp;also&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;certified&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;in&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Amazon&nbsp;Web&nbsp;Services,&nbsp;Salesforce,&nbsp;Robotic&nbsp;Path&nbsp;Automation.&nbsp;The&nbsp;students&nbsp;joining&nbsp;the&nbsp;newly&nbsp;revamped&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;equipped&nbsp;with&nbsp;niche&nbsp;technology&nbsp;and&nbsp;domain&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;which&nbsp;will&nbsp;make&nbsp;them&nbsp;competent&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;up&nbsp;certifications&nbsp;in&nbsp;these&nbsp;desired&nbsp;technologies&nbsp;and&nbsp;get&nbsp;certified.&nbsp;This&nbsp;will&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;that&nbsp;they&nbsp;will&nbsp;get&nbsp;employment&nbsp;on&nbsp;par&nbsp;with&nbsp;computer&nbsp;engineering&nbsp;graduates&nbsp;.Armed&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;eligibility&nbsp;norms,&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;look&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;is&nbsp;going&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;force&nbsp;to&nbsp;reckon&nbsp;with.&nbsp;It&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;said&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;MCA&nbsp;graduates&nbsp;equipped&nbsp;with&nbsp;3600&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;able&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;employment&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;private&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;public&nbsp;sector&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;overseas&nbsp;jobs&nbsp;and&nbsp;thereby&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;a&nbsp;fruitful&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;IT&nbsp;sector.</p>",
